            "id": "q_std3",
            "text": "All Chemicals are secured behind locked doors",
            "interpretive_guideline": "All chemicals used within the community must be secured behind locked doors at all times when not in active use. This standard is essential to protect residents, team members, and visitors from accidental exposure, ingestion, or misuse, and reflects the community's commitment to a safe living environment.\n• Housekeeping and maintenance carts are attended at all times or locked when not in direct use.\n• Chemical storage areas remain locked during walkthroughs and spot checks.\n• Staff demonstrate awareness of proper handling and storage procedures.\n• Leadership conducts routine audits to ensure compliance.",
